{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-c9fecb32a79905250ca514a6e0785c75b0586aa432e46432","family_id":"KR:007467","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Rules on Measurement of Ship Tonnage","title_original":"선박톤수의 측정에 관한 규칙","kind":"해양수산부령","source_version":"233591","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=233591","source_sha256":"86d0a65be806f7367d84c8e503c399209a614e2ef6ffb877cf8a6bbdcaf5f140","body_sha256":"6d310349b986185c7d58f9d1e902dee2529ffb84a83d37a433c7a4e68f97214b","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 46 (Light Displacement)\nThe displacement of a ship when it carries no persons, cargo or articles referred to in Article 44 (hereinafter referred to as the \"light condition\") shall be calculated by the following formula:\n\nV_D′ × (1/1,000) ρ′\n\nV_D′: Displacement volume of the ship in the light condition (cubic metres).\nρ′: Density of water or seawater (kilograms per cubic metre).\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.title.json","sha256":"c897b8af8593e31fdc2f6cb0caef7bbf94c13d2953aacc9e1b32bc312a7cd2e9"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.units.parts\\article-46.json","sha256":"6b78e123749f9f3c4f51cc7a9e62ef3d1ffda5c2c64a1ebd3a065561ba79fada"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\t